  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(1)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>FeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0142_03954343553b.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 187px;\" /></p><p>Number of unpaired&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>35</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p>(2)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>CoF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Co</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0142_34ec1e101900.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 182px;\" /></p><p>Number of unpaired&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>24</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p>(3)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Co</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0142_8fe5c88472f8.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p>Number of unpaired&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p>So, the correct order is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>FeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><msup><mfenced open=